WEBVTT

00:02.330 --> 00:06.500
After saving the Kingdom of Erille,
Helck and company resume their journey.

00:06.500 --> 00:10.080
They travel to the next town, where they
enter and win a local cooking competition.

00:10.420 --> 00:14.790
They then use their winnings to purchase a map
that will lead them back to the Empire.

00:15.710 --> 00:16.750
Right.

00:17.080 --> 00:19.420
First, we'll need to get through
the remains of the two kingdoms,

00:19.420 --> 00:21.540
and then head for this desert town.

00:21.830 --> 00:24.290
Wait, ma'am!
Here's a piece of friendly advice.

00:24.290 --> 00:26.290
You should avoid the northwest, or rather,

00:26.290 --> 00:29.080
don't go into the abandoned territory
of the two kingdoms!

00:29.290 --> 00:30.540
Why is that?

00:31.080 --> 00:33.250
A warrior of darkness prowls around there.

00:34.080 --> 00:35.670
"Warrior of darkness"?

01:02.460 --> 01:04.710
A crazed cog in the machine

01:04.710 --> 01:07.380
Lets loose a shrill cry

01:07.380 --> 01:09.380
Destined for battle and foaming at the mouth

01:09.380 --> 01:12.210
As if waiting for an opening

01:12.460 --> 01:14.540
I got dealt a dangerous card

01:14.540 --> 01:17.170
But prediciments are opportunities

01:17.170 --> 01:19.080
There's no way in hell I'm giving up

01:19.080 --> 01:21.960
The last one standing is the winner

01:22.170 --> 01:24.330
Let's just dance hand in hand

01:24.330 --> 01:27.080
With the grinning devil

01:27.080 --> 01:29.330
No need to care about appearances

01:29.330 --> 01:31.670
Courage trembles with fury

01:31.670 --> 01:34.630
Before the darkness can consume it all

01:34.830 --> 01:35.500
Break it

01:35.500 --> 01:37.000
Kick it away

01:37.000 --> 01:40.080
It's your common sense that'll be smashed to bits

01:40.080 --> 01:44.630
Ignite a flame in the soul that no one can extinguish

01:44.920 --> 01:50.330
This prayer that I now offer to the endless world

01:50.330 --> 01:55.080
Will never stop until the day comes when it gets answered

01:55.080 --> 01:56.710
Always burning

01:56.710 --> 01:59.580
It's my soul

02:06.960 --> 02:11.880
<b>The Troubadour's Song</b>

02:13.670 --> 02:15.170
Madam Iris...

02:15.170 --> 02:17.420
Hello, Miss Singing Lady!

02:17.710 --> 02:19.330
Why does she get called "Miss"?!

02:19.710 --> 02:22.580
It looks like you found your friends.
Good for you.

02:22.580 --> 02:23.580
Yep!

02:23.580 --> 02:26.170
Tell me more about this "warrior of darkness."

02:26.330 --> 02:29.920
He's a soldier that wanders the land
where the two kingdoms used to be.

02:29.920 --> 02:32.460
And crossing paths with him
means certain death.

02:32.460 --> 02:36.000
If you value your lives, then I suggest
you take the long way around.

02:37.000 --> 02:40.040
The only problem is taking a detour
like that will eat up a lot of time.

02:40.040 --> 02:41.000
Indeed.

02:41.000 --> 02:41.830
Anne.

02:41.830 --> 02:43.250
I know.

02:43.500 --> 02:44.920
Thanks for the warning.

02:44.920 --> 02:48.420
But we don't have the
luxury of time right now.

02:49.080 --> 02:50.420
I see...

02:50.420 --> 02:51.880
Listen to reason, ma'am!

02:51.880 --> 02:54.210
Death is a one-way street
that you can't come back from!

02:54.210 --> 02:57.790
It's all right.
We know how to hold our own in a fight.

02:57.790 --> 02:59.170
Thanks for the map.

02:59.790 --> 03:00.790
Let's get going.

03:01.790 --> 03:03.170
Bye-bye!

03:03.420 --> 03:04.500
Hey, Piwi!

03:05.210 --> 03:06.330
Yeah?

03:10.420 --> 03:13.000
Piwi? What are you doing? It's time to go!

03:13.000 --> 03:14.080
Okay!

03:14.080 --> 03:15.830
Bye-bye!

03:16.880 --> 03:18.710
Are you sure?

03:18.710 --> 03:21.920
Those travelers are definitely going to die...

03:28.080 --> 03:30.380
These must be the remains
of the destroyed kingdom.

03:30.750 --> 03:33.750
Since we've been following a trail
of ruined buildings for awhile now.

03:33.750 --> 03:34.880
Yeah.

03:34.880 --> 03:37.290
It must have had a pretty large population.

03:37.460 --> 03:38.880
From the way things look,

03:38.880 --> 03:41.920
it's easy to tell that a fierce war
was waged around here.

03:41.920 --> 03:44.420
And I bet a staggering amount of lives
were lost as a result.

03:58.290 --> 04:00.330
Wh-what the hell?!

04:00.830 --> 04:02.750
An ominous chill just went down my spine!

04:03.380 --> 04:05.420
Damn! Is it the warrior of darkness?!

04:23.630 --> 04:25.080
We need to get away from here!

04:25.290 --> 04:27.290
I don't what that is! But it's dangerous!

04:32.920 --> 04:34.000
No way!

04:34.000 --> 04:35.880
It closed the gap between us
in the blink of an eye!

04:40.630 --> 04:41.670
Helck?!

04:41.670 --> 04:42.670
You okay?

04:43.040 --> 04:45.290
Y-yeah. Thank you.

04:45.920 --> 04:47.080
That was too close.

04:47.080 --> 04:49.790
I was on the verge of unleashing
my spell right in Helck's face.

04:50.040 --> 04:51.960
Anyway, what the hell is that thing?

04:52.420 --> 04:54.540
It caught up to us in no time at all.

04:54.790 --> 04:57.580
And that uncanny aura emanating from it...

04:58.080 --> 05:00.670
It's similar to what I felt when
the Tothman King transformed.

05:00.960 --> 05:01.880
Anne.

05:02.750 --> 05:05.630
Grab Piwi and clear out of here.

05:06.290 --> 05:08.630
Fleeing from that thing will be difficult.

05:09.000 --> 05:11.130
So I'm going to fight it.

05:11.130 --> 05:12.330
All right.

05:12.330 --> 05:14.000
But don't push yourself too hard.

05:14.000 --> 05:15.380
That thing is supernatural.

05:15.380 --> 05:18.040
I'll come right back to help you
once Piwi is a safe distance away!

05:18.210 --> 05:19.130
Roger.

05:19.130 --> 05:20.580
Come here, Piwi!

05:20.580 --> 05:21.380
'Kay!

05:22.710 --> 05:24.080
I'm sorry...

05:24.080 --> 05:24.710
Jeez!

05:36.670 --> 05:37.670
Insane!

05:37.670 --> 05:39.710
It's powerful enough to injure even Helck!

05:40.170 --> 05:41.460
There's no doubt about it.

05:41.460 --> 05:44.830
This thing has to be the "warrior of darkness"
that girl was warning us about!

05:45.080 --> 05:46.580
Even with armor and weapons,

05:46.580 --> 05:50.580
it's still hard to believe that a being
strong enough to fight Helck exists here!

05:50.880 --> 05:52.920
Actually, it has more than
just physical strength.

05:52.920 --> 05:54.710
I also sense it drawing upon
some sinister power.

05:54.710 --> 05:56.750
But what exactly is it?!

05:57.460 --> 06:01.130
That shroud of darkness,
and its ability to teleport...

06:01.790 --> 06:03.960
I've fought against
my fair share of creatures,

06:03.960 --> 06:05.540
but I've never seen anything like this!

06:06.250 --> 06:07.170
Dammit!

06:07.380 --> 06:09.420
This is just like what happened
with the Tothman King!

06:09.420 --> 06:11.130
I'm so on edge that I can't sit still!

06:11.130 --> 06:12.880
I need to hurry back and help out!

06:17.630 --> 06:19.170
He snapped the blade in two?!

06:19.170 --> 06:20.920
What is his fist even made out of?!

06:21.210 --> 06:24.210
Nice! That should cut its power by half!

06:24.210 --> 06:26.080
The battle is practically over now!

06:27.380 --> 06:28.580
That's weird.

06:28.580 --> 06:30.580
The shadows are gathering around
the broken sword...

06:32.960 --> 06:34.040
What?!

06:34.040 --> 06:35.630
The sword is back to normal?!

06:35.630 --> 06:37.040
How does that work?!

06:37.290 --> 06:40.330
I've never heard of a weapon
that can reconstruct itself on the spot!

06:45.920 --> 06:46.790
Piwi.

06:47.460 --> 06:48.790
Keep yourself hidden here.

06:49.250 --> 06:50.460
Annie...

06:50.460 --> 06:51.790
Don't worry.

06:51.790 --> 06:53.040
I'll be back soon!

06:53.040 --> 06:54.170
'Kay...

06:54.170 --> 06:56.830
That thing has taken multiple blows
from Helck at this point,

06:56.830 --> 06:58.960
but it doesn't seem
even close to going down!

06:58.960 --> 07:02.330
Which means on top of its great strength,
speed, and stamina...

07:02.330 --> 07:04.420
it also has incredibly tough defense!

07:04.920 --> 07:08.080
And worse yet,
it may have super regenerative powers.

07:08.790 --> 07:10.960
Standard attacks aren't going to do
anything against it.

07:10.960 --> 07:13.290
I need to blow it away
with an extremely powerful move!

07:13.750 --> 07:15.000
Otherwise we can't win!

07:15.420 --> 07:16.750
All right! Try this on for size!

07:16.960 --> 07:18.250
Pull back, Helck!

07:27.790 --> 07:28.750
Shit!

07:29.040 --> 07:32.670
That attack has enough power to wipe out
your average New-World Lifeform in one go!

07:33.080 --> 07:34.920
But it didn't even scratch the damn thing!

07:36.540 --> 07:38.750
Luckily, it's wide open now.

07:38.750 --> 07:39.880
My apologies.

07:40.540 --> 07:42.130
But we don't have time to spare.

07:42.670 --> 07:45.460
So you're going to need to stay out of our way!

07:49.920 --> 07:51.290
Such incredible power!

08:09.420 --> 08:10.540
Helck!

08:25.170 --> 08:26.380
Helck!

08:29.420 --> 08:31.130
Helck's movements are getting slower.

08:31.500 --> 08:32.920
His wounds must be deep.

08:36.500 --> 08:37.500
I don't get it.

08:37.500 --> 08:41.000
How does that thing continue to survive
after taking so many hits?!

08:51.380 --> 08:52.330
Bastard!

08:52.330 --> 08:54.290
I've had enough of you!

09:00.920 --> 09:02.830
There must be a special magic at work here.

09:02.830 --> 09:05.500
A spell similar to the type Azudra uses
has been cast on this thing.

09:05.830 --> 09:09.080
And there's no way to break it
without knowing who the spellcaster is!

09:09.290 --> 09:10.750
Our only choice is to power through

09:10.750 --> 09:13.080
and escape to somewhere
that's outside the range of the spell!

09:13.380 --> 09:14.500
It's all right.

09:14.500 --> 09:17.080
If Helck and I combine our powers,
we should be able to get away!

09:23.000 --> 09:23.920
Hey.

09:24.630 --> 09:26.670
Keep your hands off my friend.

09:27.250 --> 09:29.210
Get over here and...

09:29.630 --> 09:30.880
fight me!

09:32.330 --> 09:33.420
Helck?

09:45.420 --> 09:47.630
Naturally, I'm talking about that Helck fellow.

09:48.580 --> 09:53.080
Trust me, he is someone far more dangerous
than you could ever imagine.

09:54.130 --> 09:56.250
He's okay for right now.

09:56.250 --> 09:59.630
In fact, I'm sure he'll end up
being a reliable ally.

09:59.630 --> 10:02.630
However, you can't expect that
to be the case forever.

10:03.130 --> 10:06.750
There is a vortex of negative emotions
bottled up inside of him.

10:07.080 --> 10:09.080
He walks a road to darkness.

10:09.080 --> 10:12.630
And who can say what lies at the end
of the hopeless goal he seeks?

10:13.080 --> 10:15.040
You must never forget.

10:15.040 --> 10:18.830
Hidden inside of the man
who you travel with is the potential

10:18.830 --> 10:20.920
to bring about a great calamity.

10:21.580 --> 10:23.290
Make the right choice.

10:26.630 --> 10:29.130
That's enough, Helck! Just run away!

10:29.130 --> 10:31.880
That thing is invincible! Stop fighting it!

10:31.880 --> 10:33.630
Don't use any more of your power!

10:34.040 --> 10:35.080
Are you listening?!

10:35.290 --> 10:36.330
Helck!

10:36.540 --> 10:38.250
HELCK!

10:50.880 --> 10:51.960
Piwi!

10:52.790 --> 10:54.130
What are you doing?!

10:54.130 --> 10:55.210
Annie!

10:55.210 --> 10:57.460
I thought I told you to stay put!

10:58.960 --> 11:01.580
Chweep, cheep, cheep, chweeb, cheep!

11:01.580 --> 11:03.210
Don't you "chweeb" at me! Fool!

11:04.250 --> 11:05.920
Just hide somewhere for the tim-

11:15.040 --> 11:16.750
It stopped being hostile...

11:33.960 --> 11:36.710
Why would the warrior of darkness
stop all of a sudden?

11:36.710 --> 11:38.380
I talked with the Singing Lady earlier!

11:38.380 --> 11:40.500
She said I should sing that song
if we get into trouble!

11:40.500 --> 11:42.210
What? Are you serious?

11:42.210 --> 11:43.790
Your singing stopped it?!

11:43.790 --> 11:45.580
I had to come a long way to get back here!

11:46.290 --> 11:50.250
Hold on, does that mean I actually made
the situation worse by taking you to safety?!

11:56.250 --> 11:58.500
Are you okay, Helck?

11:58.500 --> 12:00.710
Yeah. I'm fine.

12:00.710 --> 12:02.460
I just flew off the handle a little.

12:02.460 --> 12:04.580
It was more than "a little," you fool!

12:04.580 --> 12:06.420
Don't worry me like that.

12:06.420 --> 12:08.880
Yeah. I'm sorry.

12:10.630 --> 12:14.380
I hope your wounds aren't too bad.
Let me stop the bleeding for you.

12:14.380 --> 12:15.500
Just wait here.

12:15.500 --> 12:18.380
Thank you, but that's all right.

12:22.830 --> 12:24.420
What the hell was that?!

12:24.420 --> 12:26.250
It's my super recovery mode.

12:26.250 --> 12:28.250
My wounds should heal over before long.

12:28.250 --> 12:30.000
Whoa! That's amazing!

12:34.880 --> 12:36.750
It isn't regenerating from its wounds...

12:37.460 --> 12:40.500
Anne, is it okay if we follow after it?

12:41.330 --> 12:42.540
Helck...

13:11.630 --> 13:15.000
We don't know what to expect in there.
Keep your wits about you.

13:15.000 --> 13:16.080
Right.

13:25.250 --> 13:26.380
Look.

13:26.750 --> 13:28.540
Are those victims from the war?

13:33.580 --> 13:36.710
Peace was all that we desired.

13:37.290 --> 13:40.170
Everyone was against the idea of war.

13:40.170 --> 13:42.880
Wait... it can speak?

13:43.130 --> 13:47.670
However, as our friends
and family were murdered,

13:47.670 --> 13:52.710
people began to resent the other kingdom
and fully embraced their rage.

13:53.330 --> 13:56.920
Soon enough, there was no one left
who objected to fighting back.

13:58.000 --> 14:00.000
Things spiraled out control from there.

14:00.790 --> 14:03.420
The scale of the war grew larger
on a daily basis,

14:03.420 --> 14:07.080
and the hatred that it spawned broke the
seal upon the forbidden magic of this land

14:07.080 --> 14:10.130
known as "the hex of darkness."

14:10.420 --> 14:11.420
That set us...

14:12.170 --> 14:14.380
on the path to ruin.

14:15.170 --> 14:20.420
All the knights of the kingdom who used
the hex of darkness to boost their strength

14:20.420 --> 14:25.000
gradually lost their minds
and mutated into vile monsters.

14:25.000 --> 14:27.130
Then went on a widespread massacre.

14:28.130 --> 14:32.210
The hex of darkness undoubtedly brought
an end to the war between the two kingdoms,

14:32.210 --> 14:34.250
but it also destroyed everything.

14:35.040 --> 14:36.830
The monsters continue to rampage.

14:37.250 --> 14:39.960
Those fortunate enough to escape
the effects of the hex

14:39.960 --> 14:42.420
did everything they could
to fight back and survive.

14:43.080 --> 14:47.420
But they were helpless against
the power of darkness.

14:47.880 --> 14:49.920
There was only one hope left.

14:50.330 --> 14:53.460
Although it came with the risk
of producing a new monster,

14:53.460 --> 14:58.330
the only chance we had was to rely on
the same power of darkness.

14:59.290 --> 15:01.000
I wanted to save my people.

15:01.290 --> 15:03.330
And there was someone
I was so desperate to protect,

15:03.330 --> 15:05.210
I didn't care what happened to me.

15:05.210 --> 15:09.080
That sentiment became the anchor
that kept me sane.

15:09.960 --> 15:10.830
But then...

15:13.040 --> 15:15.000
STOP!

15:15.670 --> 15:16.880
I understand now.

15:16.880 --> 15:20.960
He became a warrior of darkness
to try and save his people.

15:21.130 --> 15:24.330
I swore I would never succumb
to the hex of darkness...

15:24.960 --> 15:27.500
I swore that I would keep her safe
no matter what...

15:28.290 --> 15:29.630
but I failed.

15:30.960 --> 15:35.830
In the end, I couldn't save...
a single one of them..

15:36.130 --> 15:37.460
Brave warriors.

15:37.880 --> 15:41.330
Although I was in a trance,
I do remember our battle.

15:42.460 --> 15:43.920
You are strong.

15:44.500 --> 15:47.380
And thanks to you,
I was able to regain my sanity.

15:47.830 --> 15:49.210
You have my gratitude.

15:50.170 --> 15:53.080
Y-you're... falling apart...

15:53.540 --> 15:56.790
My physical form was already destroyed
many ages ago.

15:57.210 --> 16:00.000
Now that I am free from the hex of darkness,

16:00.000 --> 16:02.380
this body will soon crumble to dust.

16:02.380 --> 16:03.420
What?!

16:05.880 --> 16:09.080
Ah, I see. You also...

16:11.580 --> 16:13.750
That's an impressive weapon you have there.

16:14.130 --> 16:17.540
Go figure. I'd never have guessed
something like that existed.

16:19.750 --> 16:23.580
But we both know it's not something
you should be in possession of.

16:24.000 --> 16:25.710
Take this with you.

16:27.460 --> 16:29.130
Consider it an apology and a gift.

16:29.130 --> 16:31.080
It does bear a minor curse,

16:31.080 --> 16:32.920
but I'm sure that you can wield it.

16:33.210 --> 16:34.290
A curse...

16:35.380 --> 16:38.830
You will be faced with
more battles in the future,

16:38.830 --> 16:40.080
and I know it will prove useful.

16:40.290 --> 16:41.580
Please use it.

16:43.460 --> 16:45.790
I'm sorry. And thank you.

16:46.040 --> 16:48.290
Don't end up on the same path I did.

16:48.830 --> 16:50.290
I wish you luck.

16:54.170 --> 16:57.000
I guess... this is it.

16:57.670 --> 17:01.330
Before I go, can I bother you
with one final request?

17:01.330 --> 17:02.330
What is it?

17:02.960 --> 17:06.540
That song from earlier...
would you sing it for me again?

17:07.290 --> 17:09.080
I always loved that song.

17:11.630 --> 17:13.750
Piwi. Can you do it?

17:13.750 --> 17:15.250
Yep!

17:16.790 --> 17:19.580
Wait, Piwi. Let me sing the song for him.

17:20.460 --> 17:22.130
Miss Singing Lady!

17:24.250 --> 17:26.880
Curiosity got the better of me,
so I followed you.

17:27.580 --> 17:29.080
You're so powerful.

17:29.420 --> 17:30.880
Never in my wildest dreams

17:30.880 --> 17:33.330
did I think someone strong enough
to save him would come.

17:33.330 --> 17:34.290
Huh?

17:46.290 --> 17:47.420
It can't be...

18:01.710 --> 18:03.420
Augis.

18:03.420 --> 18:05.210
My big brother, Augis.

18:05.210 --> 18:07.250
It's me. Can you tell?

18:07.250 --> 18:08.580
I'm Iris!

18:09.290 --> 18:12.000
Th-this is unbelievable...

18:12.000 --> 18:13.750
How did you survive?

18:14.790 --> 18:16.000
You don't remember?

18:16.290 --> 18:18.630
You're the one who saved my life!

18:19.710 --> 18:20.750
Me?

18:25.000 --> 18:26.960
STOP!

18:26.960 --> 18:30.460
The hex of darkness deprived you
of all awareness,

18:30.460 --> 18:33.000
but you protected me, Big Brother.

18:36.250 --> 18:37.750
And I'm not the only one!

18:37.750 --> 18:41.420
You ended up saving many of our people!

18:41.420 --> 18:44.960
Really? I did?

18:44.960 --> 18:46.830
Yes. Yes.

18:49.080 --> 18:50.670
I'm sorry.

18:50.670 --> 18:52.960
I wish I could have saved you sooner.

18:53.460 --> 18:55.000
I'm so sorry!

18:55.000 --> 18:57.210
No, it's okay.

18:57.750 --> 18:59.460
I'm just glad you're safe.

19:01.420 --> 19:02.460
Truly...

19:03.880 --> 19:05.920
Anne. Piwi.

19:05.920 --> 19:07.040
Let's go.

19:08.000 --> 19:08.960
Right.

19:40.670 --> 19:43.460
I promise you

19:43.460 --> 19:46.420
Someday when the world

19:46.420 --> 19:48.540
Comes to an end

19:48.540 --> 19:51.170
I hope we meet once again

20:03.250 --> 20:08.630
Someone once told me

20:08.630 --> 20:14.500
You were like a flower

20:14.500 --> 20:20.040
In a room without water, yet surely

20:20.040 --> 20:22.540
Blooming towards tomorrow

20:24.250 --> 20:27.040
If it was all a dream

20:27.040 --> 20:29.960
To know you

20:29.960 --> 20:32.880
To be in love

20:32.880 --> 20:36.380
I wouldn't know the meaning of life

20:37.210 --> 20:40.000
Even if tomorrow

20:40.000 --> 20:42.710
The rain pours

20:42.710 --> 20:45.080
Dawn will come and

20:45.080 --> 20:48.170
Rainbows will arch over the world

20:48.540 --> 20:51.250
The pain in my heart

20:51.250 --> 20:54.130
The tears trickling down

20:54.130 --> 20:57.540
Let's turn it into seeds for the future

20:57.540 --> 20:59.170
We go on

20:59.880 --> 21:01.920
Until our clumsy love

21:01.920 --> 21:05.080
Blooms into a flower

21:07.670 --> 21:10.290
Seems like it's a long way
until we reach the next town.

21:10.290 --> 21:13.000
Yeah. We might have to camp outside tonight.

21:13.000 --> 21:16.380
You know, it's really great those two
had the chance to reunite.

21:18.540 --> 21:20.500
Annie! Helck!

21:20.500 --> 21:21.670
Look!

21:23.630 --> 21:25.830
I guess there was once a town here, too.

21:26.920 --> 21:30.080
Cool, so whoever falls off the bricks is the loser!

21:30.250 --> 21:31.460
Whaddya mean by that?!

21:31.460 --> 21:33.330
We're gonna have a race to that tree!

21:33.330 --> 21:34.380
Absolutely not.

21:34.380 --> 21:37.080
We have no idea what kind of
dangerous creatures might be out there.

21:37.080 --> 21:39.790
Which means that we have
to proceed with caution.

21:39.790 --> 21:40.830
Okay!

21:40.830 --> 21:42.080
Don't you start!

21:42.080 --> 21:44.540
We have to conserve our stamina, dammit!

21:44.540 --> 21:46.580
On your marks!

21:46.580 --> 21:47.630
Don't even!

21:47.630 --> 21:49.420
We are not doing this!
Do you hear me?!

21:49.420 --> 21:50.290
Get set!

21:51.040 --> 21:52.000
Go!

21:52.540 --> 21:54.290
Fine then, I'm not holding anything back!

21:57.290 --> 21:59.750
Look at that heavy bag!
And his huge body!

21:59.750 --> 22:02.210
Just how the hell is he
so light on his feet despite all of that?!

22:02.460 --> 22:06.000
I know I've said it a million times before,
but I'll say it again!

22:06.000 --> 22:07.670
That guy is a freak of nature!

22:09.290 --> 22:10.170
Huh?

22:14.460 --> 22:17.540
Looks like someone chose
the wrong wall to run along!

22:17.540 --> 22:18.920
YOU LOSE!

22:18.920 --> 22:21.040
I haven't lost yet!

22:27.380 --> 22:29.000
WHAT THE FLYING HELL?!

22:29.000 --> 22:31.210
I knew you were a damn bird!

22:31.210 --> 22:34.710
But I'm not a bird! I'm a Piwi!

22:35.330 --> 22:37.790
YOU'RE ABOUT TO BE
MONSTER FOOD AGAIN!

22:37.790 --> 22:39.580
Negligence is the greatest enemy!

22:39.580 --> 22:43.380
Remember to exercise utmost caution
when traveling into the unknown!

22:45.960 --> 22:50.880
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:45.960 --> 22:50.880
<b>The Spirit of Faith</b>

22:46.790 --> 22:49.540
Next time: "The Spirit of Faith"
